function <<PCT.function, PCT.platformOnly>> {platform::pure::profiles::doc.doc = 'Diagnostic counters for a map: its size, and how many times a value has been computed on a miss.\n\nIntended for inspecting cache behaviour when a map is used with\n`getIfAbsentPutWithKey(Map<U, V>[1], U[1], Function<{U[1]->V[0..1]}>[1]):V[0..1]` — a rising\n`getIfAbsentCounter` relative to `size` indicates repeated misses. The result is `[0..1]`, so a map\nthat keeps no statistics yields an empty value.\n\n**Parameters**\n- `m` — the map to inspect.\n\n**Returns** the map\'s statistics, or an empty value if none are recorded.\n\n**Examples**\n```pure\n$m->getMapStats().size\n$m->getMapStats().getIfAbsentCounter\n```\n\n**See also** `getIfAbsentPutWithKey(Map<U, V>[1], U[1], Function<{U[1]->V[0..1]}>[1]):V[0..1]`'} meta::pure::functions::collection::getMapStats<U,V>(m: Map<U, V>[1]): meta::pure::functions::collection::MapStats[0..1]
{
  []->toOne('not bridged: meta::pure::functions::collection::getMapStats')
}
